                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Every route reveals more of the story. Their method of locking certain routes until you have enough information allowed you to gradually unlock the truth. With each new route it felt like peeling another layer of complexity. I loved all of the characters for different reasons and discovered a greater appreciation after fully completing their route. Overall, I loved unravelling the truth of these stories and I believe this game is worth 20 dollars.\n\nMy biggest complaint is that these characters were limited to this game. I wish we could explore more of their future or even their lives before the memory loss in another game or book or movie. I would take anything to see them again. \n\nWorks on mac. (achievements only unlock after the ending sequence)",
